        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-10T15:21:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if it\u0027d be correct implicitly pick a \"last frozen\" version from the directories in prebuilts/module_sdks. With unbundled modules on their own independent branches, that directory will also be unbundled and hence shared between platform versions. That means each platform (SDK extension) version needs to specify which versions of the modules it contains, doesn\u0027t it?",
      "parentUuid": "5c70ac53_28a1858f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 35
      },
